      "text": "worked on following\n- SEC 10b51 2023 Rules Implementation\n- API' optimiaztions for client to reduce timeout error \n- Angular to react Migration (CRC and Stockplan) owned\n- Other pricing Level feature Implementations\n- identified and split mobile and web api's\n- reduced aggregators calls ",
